{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10536","headline":"辟阳城 · 高适","name":"辟阳城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒城在高岸，凌眺俯清淇。\n传道汉天子，而封审食其。\n奸淫且不戮，茅土孰云宜。\n何得英雄主，返令儿女欺。\n母仪良已失，臣节岂如斯。\n太息一朝事，乃令人所嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}